  triage:description "PR #769 QA-2 (reviewed commit e2100f038949486fd3fb66c7ba4d13412e681bfa), original finding id AL3-RH-003/CR-008 (architecture-guard variant, slash sanitized to ARCHGUARD suffix for this record): crates/atm-architecture/tests/boundary_enforcement.rs around line 1909 defines a boundary-enforcement scan whose symbol/file scope list is too narrow to catch the class of leak this sprint introduced/risked, per the QA-2 report." ;
